{"appid": 3444020, "gama": {"steamId": 3444020, "id": 3444020, "name": "Demonic Mahjong", "copiesSold": 300013, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1752537600000, "releaseDate": 1752537600000, "price": 16.99, "developers": ["Boxed Lighting Games"], "publishers": ["Omegames Studio", "NPC Entertainment"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 96, "genres": ["Casual", "Strategy"], "tags": ["Strategy", "Card Game", "Roguelike", "Tabletop", "Casual", "3D", "Mahjong", "Deckbuilding", "Relaxing", "Funny", "Sexual Content", "Cartoony", "Anime", "Fantasy", "Singleplayer", "Comedy", "Cartoon", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Artificial Intelligence", "Nudity"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "我在地府打麻将 - Demonic Mahjong", "steam_appid": 3444020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4027650, 4817180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >奥秘游戏是一家独立游戏工作室，致力于打造具有文化特色和沉浸体验的游戏作品。我们目前已推出《山河旅探》和《我在地府打麻将》，欢迎大家关注并加入我们的玩家社区，获取最新游戏资讯和动态！</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新浪微博：@山河旅探</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B站：山河旅探、我在地府打麻将</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小黑盒：奥秘游戏、我在地府打麻将</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家十三群QQ号：1065520829</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家十四群QQ号：1050241208</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╭(●｀∀´●)╯╰(●’◡’●)╮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《我地麻》是一款以麻将为灵感并结合了麻将基础玩法的卡牌构筑肉鸽游戏，在这个大家都疯狂沉迷打麻将的地府，上至阎罗、下至女鬼，个个都是搓麻高手，当然，这里的麻将与阳间大有不同——它更狂野、更丰富、充满了策略性和意外性。用你手中的麻将构筑出强大的番型组合、胡出难以想象的超高分数、针对Boss特点形成独特的制胜策略吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/2b4c7ca44e5c29bcfbe0b5f254cf1e6c.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/2b4c7ca44e5c29bcfbe0b5f254cf1e6c.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/2b4c7ca44e5c29bcfbe0b5f254cf1e6c.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/d6a25cc8d04a63e914366e47a0efa9ca.avif?t=1788501887\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏特色：</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>像麻将，又不是麻将</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·得分遵循基本胡牌番型，会麻将就能上手；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·在麻将基础上融合肉鸽玩法，找到你的最佳策略来胡把大的！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·不仅仅是胡出高分，更重要的是找到击败对面的boss的方法！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/1bbbaa55b8b2ced210464baff6b5e500.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/1bbbaa55b8b2ced210464baff6b5e500.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/1bbbaa55b8b2ced210464baff6b5e500.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/70dbe1dceaa627d102cf64c5ee3b676e.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/70dbe1dceaa627d102cf64c5ee3b676e.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/70dbe1dceaa627d102cf64c5ee3b676e.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>极具深度的搓麻策略</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·100个灵俑，每一个都能帮你组合出独特的策略或彻底改变核心打法；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·100个遗物，为你的对局提供强大的增益效果和永久成长；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·35个祭品，改变你的手牌，提供特殊能力让你操纵手牌/牌库，甚至获得更好的“手气”；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·17种牌灵和12种牌面变体，强化的你的麻将手牌，打出更强效果；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/830e65feb25c9b724e69128367558b06.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/830e65feb25c9b724e69128367558b06.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/830e65feb25c9b724e69128367558b06.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/7418016bc9297f10add87352d15bb770.avif?t=1788501887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras_big/7418016bc9297f10add87352d15bb770.avif?t=1788501887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/ddd36e05d0388f05022eb4dc713cbcac.avif?t=1788501887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras_big/ddd36e05d0388f05022eb4dc713cbcac.avif?t=1788501887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>打造你的地府超强战队</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·每个角色拥有其独特的【主动技能】和【被动技能】；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·围绕角色形成独特且强力的番型组合、构筑流派与核心玩法；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·每个角色均可升级其技能等级，还计划推出角色好感度系统！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/b501c9ed01f014c99876d7c490ae77e2.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/b501c9ed01f014c99876d7c490ae77e2.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/b501c9ed01f014c99876d7c490ae77e2.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/fff001b1f7b752b0686fedc823b149f1.avif?t=1788501887\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>独特的事件系统</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在孟婆奶茶店干一杯忘忧奶茶？帮害羞女鬼完成她的请求？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·10个常规事件、90个特殊事件，让你的麻将之旅充满意外</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·你在事件中的行为和选择将会对后续对局产生极大的影响</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/cc166316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/cc166316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/cc166316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/869f7dfb9251966a263651927e96c676.avif?t=1788501887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras_big/869f7dfb9251966a263651927e96c676.avif?t=1788501887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>各具特色的boss战</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >孟婆、牛头马面、四大判官等24个各具特色的地府boss陪伴你的每次地府之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·她们具有各自的主动技能和被动技能，研究出属于你的获胜之道！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·不论是输给她们还是击败她们都有特别的演出效果(≧▽≦)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/019608e24d27f1cd7d4f6ff9ae4f43d7.avif?t=1788501887\" width=800 height=447 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >奥秘游戏是一家独立游戏工作室，致力于打造具有文化特色和沉浸体验的游戏作品。我们目前已推出《山河旅探》和《我在地府打麻将》，欢迎大家关注并加入我们的玩家社区，获取最新游戏资讯和动态！</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新浪微博：@山河旅探</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B站：山河旅探、我在地府打麻将</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小黑盒：奥秘游戏、我在地府打麻将</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家十三群QQ号：1065520829</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家十四群QQ号：1050241208</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╭(●｀∀´●)╯╰(●’◡’●)╮</p><p class=\"bb_para