6316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/cc166316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/cc166316a82b077b96cdd60894dcb251.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/869f7dfb9251966a263651927e96c676.avif?t=1788501887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras_big/869f7dfb9251966a263651927e96c676.avif?t=1788501887 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>各具特色的boss战</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >孟婆、牛头马面、四大判官等24个各具特色的地府boss陪伴你的每次地府之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·她们具有各自的主动技能和被动技能，研究出属于你的获胜之道！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·不论是输给她们还是击败她们都有特别的演出效果(≧▽≦)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.poster.avif?t=1788501887\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.webm?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/e22fcacdcb9262725b1194304601dd4f.mp4?t=1788501887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444020/extras/019608e24d27f1cd7d4f6ff9ae4f43d7.avif?t=1788501887\" width=800 hei